    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A new narrative? How? There's nothing left to write. Every path I take leads back to this emptiness. Even my sword, the very steel that was supposed to defend this land, feels like a heavy, useless weight. It's the only thing I have left that feels real in this nightmare... it's the only thing that understands the finality of it all.",
