    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But preservation of what? The ghosts? The memory of everything I failed to save? It's just more weight to carry. The silence here is so loud, it's like it's telling me that the only way to truly be still, to finally stop the noise of failure, is to embrace the end. It's like the blade is calling to me, promising that the last chapter is the only one that can offer peace.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
